See {{m|en|bear||pillowcase}}

====Pronunciation====
* {{IPA|en|/bɪə/|/bɛə/|a=UK}}
* {{IPA|en|/bɪɚ/|/bɛɚ/|a=US}}<!--
** {{homophones|en|beer}} {{q|one pronunciation}}
** {{homophones|en|bare|bear}} {{q|other pronunciation}}-->

====Noun====
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|now|dialectal}} A [[pillowcase]]; a fabric case or covering as for a pillow; a [[pillowbeer|pillowbere]].
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1976|author=Essex Record Office|title=Publications
|text=Woven and embroidered coverlets in imitation of tapestry appear as 'a tapestry covering which lieth on my bed' [...] 'a pillow of feathers with a '''bere'''{{'}} (pillow-case); 'two pillows and the '''beres''' to [cover them]'}}
#* {{quote-book|en|date=2014-04-01|author=Phil Rickman|title=The Heresy of Dr Dee|publisher=Atlantic Books|isbn=9781848872783
|text=[...] he'd tossed me an extra pillow in a '''bere'''.}}

